# Gorilla 158 port fix
# D-157-00: UITour's showFirefoxAccountsForAIWindow is inert. The 158 rebase removed the Smart Window and its lazy getter but kept two lazy.AIWindow uses (undefined when the line runs), and the case let a web page switch browser.ai.control.smartWindow back to 'available'. Found by the owner's preflight (lazy-getters) at build-run on Windows 2026-10-16; the gate's symbols check now catches it (undeclared lazy names the port introduced). lesson: an excision must remove every use of what it removes, and the gate must look for undeclared lazy names
# Files: browser/components/uitour/UITour.sys.mjs

